    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36265" root="قنب" body-key="q">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَانِبٌ</span></b>  The <i>howling wolf.</i> (O, K.) See also
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَقَانِبُ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <i>A quick,</i> or <i>brisk,</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَيْج</span> [i. e.
<i>foot-messenger,</i> or <i>courier who journeys on foot</i>];
as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَيْنَابٌ</span></b> . (O, K. [In the CK, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الفَيْحُ</span> is
put for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الفَيْجُ</span>.]) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَادٍ قَانِبٌ</span> [<i>A valley,</i> or
<i>water-course,</i>] <i>of which the torrent comes from
afar.</i> (O.)

